{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REGOLITH: VIOZIC SUNS is a top-down, roguelite space shooter game for PC set within a handcrafted and procedurally-generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of an illegally-immortal mercenary pilot looking to secure their name in fame and notoriety with the help of a motley crew of contractors that may or may not have your best interests in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter your ship's equipment and internals to your liking and playstyle - or towards the needs of your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and push the limits of where you're allowed to be...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>REGOLITH is still in its early development stages, and has a long way to go. Please be patient, I'm just one guy!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3279270?t=1756855786","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756855786","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279270/b19af9cb1cfbb88f9b68b6222828bd8d309b5fc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756855786","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279270/b19af9cb1cfbb88f9b68b6222828bd8d309b5fc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756855786","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3747560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REGOLITH: VIOZIC SUNS is a top-down, roguelite space shooter game for PC set within a handcrafted and procedurally-generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of an illegally-immortal mercenary pilot looking to secu